<title>UK: Yorkshire up on U.S. bid reports.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire up on U.S. bid reports.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Yorkshire Electicity Plc rose early on Monday after a report in the Sunday Telegraph said Entergy Corp of the U.S. was considering a 1.3 billion stg bid for the UK utility.</p>
<p>Yorkshire shares were up 8p at 743-1/2 by 0857 GMT in thin trading of just 84,321 shares.  </p>
<p>A spokesman for Yorkshire said the report was no-more than market speculation. &quot;We have not had any approaches and we are not in any talks,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
